Description: Stub PdfViewerPrivateGlicSummarizeFunction to avoid glic dependency
 The pdf_viewer_private_api.cc references the glic (Google AI assistant)
 namespace which is not available in Debian builds. A prior Debian Chromium
 patch removed the glic includes but the function body was not updated due to
 a partial patch application failure (.rej). This patch completes the stub by
 replacing the full glic-dependent Run() body with a simple error return, and
 removes the now-unused includes (tabs/tab_interface.h, absl/cleanup).
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-04-08

